        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "**Visual exercise 2: two-hop coordination path**",
          "",
          "Now start with Colorado Benefits Network (`@co-benefits`) and follow two `connects_to` edges. Read the `MATCH` pattern as a three-part path: `source` is the starting partner, `middle` is the intermediary, and `destination` is the organization reached through the second handoff.",
          "",
          "The `WHERE` clause keeps the investigation focused on one known partner, and `COLUMNS` returns the source, intermediary, destination, and both handoff identifiers for the graph visualization. Use the intermediary and destination to discuss a focused coordination conversation; the path is evidence to review, not an automatic referral or eligibility decision."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : "[{\"visualization\":{\"ruleBasedStyles\":[{\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"aggregationEnabled\":true,\"modifierStyles\":{},\"style\":{\"dasharray\":\"5\",\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)\"},\"properties\":{\"style\":[\"dashed\"]},\"_id\":1583324064459,\"target\":\"edge\",\"type\":\"styling\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"hiddenConnection\",\"operator\":\"*\",\"value\":\"\"}]},\"component\":\"edge\",\"legendTitle\":\"Hidden Connection\",\"_fromTemplate\":true},{\"_id\":\"d7c6d90\",\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"vertex\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"BRAND\"}]},\"component\":\"vertex\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8FBFD0\"},\"legendTitle\":\"BRAND\",\"isDefaultRule\":true},{\"_id\":\"-71f57e66\",\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"vertex\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"INFLUENCER\"}]},\"component\":\"vertex\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#F0CC71\"},\"legendTitle\":\"INFLUENCER\",\"isDefaultRule\":true},{\"_id\":\"31d21dd\",\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"edge\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"PROMOTES\"}]},\"component\":\"edge\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8B8580\"},\"legendTitle\":\"PROMOTES\",\"isDefaultRule\":true},{\"_id\":\"-2ce1f8e1\",\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"edge\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"CONNECTS_TO\"}]},\"component\":\"edge\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8B8580\"},\"legendTitle\":\"CONNECTS_TO\",\"isDefaultRule\":true}],\"displaySizeOnLoad\":10,\"lastColumns\":[\"PROGRAM_ID\",\"SOURCE_PARTNER_ID\",\"PROGRAM_LINK_ID\",\"HANDOFF_ID\",\"CONNECTED_PARTNER_ID\"],\"version\":11}}]",
